  "text": "Lewati ke konten\n\nbiz@rdk.co.id\n\n+62 21 7279 0955\n\nEnglish\nIndonesian\nContact\nAbout\nServices\nOur Equipment\nProject\nMarket\nArticle\nIntegrated Engineering & Construction Solutions\n\nEngineering, heavy-lift, and construction solutions to support your industrial projects.\n\nConsult About Your Project\n\nAbout Us\n\nEngineering Expertise for Complex Projects\nEstablished in 2020, PT Reka Daya Kencana is an engineering, heavy-lift, and construction company specializing in integrated solutions. If you can imagine it, we can make it happen. No matter the level of difficulty, our team will create safe and proven engineering solutions.\nLearn More About Us\n\nServices\n\nIntegrated Services for Complex Industrial Projects\nEngineering, procurement, construction, and heavy lifting services to meet a wide range of industrial project needs.\nEngineering\nPlanning, technical studies, and engineering design to ensure the appropriate technical approach for each project.\nProcurement\nProcurement of project equipment and materials to ensure the smooth progress of construction.\nConstruction\nConstruction of various industrial and infrastructure facilities.\nHeavy Lifting Project\nHeavy-lift and transportation solutions for the installation of industrial equipment and large-scale structures.\n\nEquipment\n\nSpecialized Equipment to Support Your Project\nSpecialized equipment to safely and precisely handle the lifting, moving, and installation of industrial components\nLift & Slide System\nOur jacking and skidding system technology enables the horizontal movement of heavy structures and components\nRead More\nMeasurement, Modeling, & Surveys\nThis is done to ensure accuracy at every stage of project planning and implementation.\nRead More\nGantry Hidraulik\nOur high-capacity equipment is used for the lifting and installation of industrial machinery.\nRead More\nSpecialty Construction Equipment\nThe heavy transport fleet includes Self-Propelled Modular Transporters (SPMTs), multi-axle trailers, low-bed trailers, and cranes\nRead More\nLift & Slide System\nOur jacking and skidding system technology enables the horizontal movement of heavy structures and components\nRead More\nMeasurement, Modeling, & Surveys\nThis is done to ensure accuracy at every stage of project planning and implementation.\nRead More\nGantry Hidraulik\nOur high-capacity equipment is used for the lifting and installation of industrial machinery.\nRead More\nSpecialty Construction Equipment\nThe heavy transport fleet includes Self-Propelled Modular Transporters (SPMTs), multi-axle trailers, low-bed trailers, and cranes\nRead More\n\nIndustry\n\nOur Capabilities Across Various Industrial Sectors\nWe support a wide range of industries with tailored and reliable solutions.\nOffshore Platform & Module\nPower Plant\nGeneral Industrial\nInfrastructure\nOil, Gas, & Petrochemical\nMineral, Mining, & Metal\nLogistics & Freight Forwarding\nOffshore Platform & Module\nPower Plant\nGeneral Industrial\nInfrastructure\nOil, Gas, & Petrochemical\nMineral, Mining, & Metal\nLogistics & Freight Forwarding\nOffshore Platform & Module\n\nProject\n\nSome Projects We Have Completed\nView All Projects\nLahat, Sumatera Selatan\n2026\n150 kV Transmission Tower Foundation, Lahat\nRead More\nWaru, Jawa Timur\n2026\n500 kV Transmission Tower Foundation, Waru\nRead More\nPLN NP UP Tenayan\n2026\nWarehouse Repair PLN NP UP Tenayan, Riau (2026)\nRead More\nGarut, West Java\n2026\nDevelopment of Phase 1B Ecobizz Garut\nRead More\nDistrict Menteng\n2026\nRenovation of 100 Houses, Menteng (2026)\nRead More\nPLN NP UP Tenayan\n2025 - 2026\nWarehouse Structural Repair PLN NP UP Tenayan, Riau (2025-2026)\nRead More\n\nArticles & Insights\n\nInsights and Information About the Industry\nView All Articles\n\nInformation\n\nMEMPERINGATI MAULID NABI MUHAMMAD SAW\nRead More\n25\n\nAgustus\n\n2026\n\nInformation\n\nDIRGAHAYU REPUBLIK INDONESIA KE-81\nRead More\n17\n\nAgustus\n\n2026\n\nActivity\n\nCelebrating PT Reka Daya Kencana’s 3-Year Journey: Building Trust, Strengthening the Team, and Sustaining Growth\nRead More\n11\n\nApril\n\n2026\n\nContact Us\nWe’re Ready to Support Your Project\nDiscuss your project needs with the PT Reka Daya Kencana team to find the right engineering solution.\nDiscuss Your Project\nWith the support of experienced professionals and specialized equipment, PT Reka Daya Kencana is committed to providing safe, efficient, and reliable engineering solutions for a wide range of industrial sectors.\nLinkedin-in\nHome\nAbout\nService\nMarket\nOur Equipment\nProject\nArticles\nCONTACT INFORMATION\nPlaza Daniprisma, Jl. Sultan Hasanudin No.48, Melawai, Kec. Kby. Baru, Kota Jakarta Selatan,\nDKI Jakarta 12160\n+62 21 7279 0955\nbiz@rdk.co.id\nSERVICES\nEngineering\nProcurement\nConstruction\nHeavy Lifting Project\nCERTIFICATION\nISO 45001:2018\nISO 37001:2016\nISO 21500:2021\nISO 14001:2015\nISO 9001:2015\n\n© 2026 PT Reka Daya Kencana.",
